<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores in four-day Sheffield Shield cricket matches on Friday.</p>
<p>In Brisbane, second day - Queensland first innings 460 for six (Stuart Law 144, Jimmy Maher 91, Ian Healy 82 not out, Andrew Symonds 50); New South Wales first innings 190 (Steve Waugh 55, Andrew Bichel six for 56).</p>
<p>In Perth, first day - South Australia 231 for eight (James Brayshaw 73, Darren Lehmann 52) v Western Australia.</p>
